1
00:00:02,757 --> 00:00:05,427
Kirito: ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

2
00:00:05,427 --> 00:00:06,977
♪

3
00:00:10,597 --> 00:00:13,107
( yells )

4
00:00:13,107 --> 00:00:14,567
( woman vocalizing )

5
00:00:21,277 --> 00:00:22,867
( Fanatio grunting )

6
00:00:24,577 --> 00:00:26,247
( Kirito grunting )

7
00:00:26,247 --> 00:00:27,447
( yells )

8
00:00:38,667 --> 00:00:40,677
( Fanatio gasping )

9
00:00:46,057 --> 00:00:47,977
♪

10
00:00:58,357 --> 00:00:59,397
Eugeo: KIRITO.

11
00:00:59,397 --> 00:01:01,107
KIRITO!

12
00:01:01,107 --> 00:01:03,737
SAY SOMETHING! KIRITO!

13
00:01:03,737 --> 00:01:05,447
( singing in Japanese )

14
00:01:05,447 --> 00:01:07,947
♪

15
00:01:36,687 --> 00:01:38,977
♪ PROUD OF MYSELF ♪

16
00:01:46,237 --> 00:01:48,157
♪

17
00:02:37,697 --> 00:02:38,747
Eugeo: KIRITO!

18
00:02:38,747 --> 00:02:40,117
COME ON. WAKE UP!

19
00:02:44,127 --> 00:02:45,497
( gasps )

20
00:02:45,497 --> 00:02:47,167
SYSTEM CALL.

21
00:02:47,167 --> 00:02:49,257
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT!

22
00:02:52,717 --> 00:02:54,217
( sighs )

23
00:02:57,307 --> 00:02:59,387
SYSTEM CALL.

24
00:02:59,387 --> 00:03:02,137
TRANSFER HUMAN UNIT DURABILITY.

25
00:03:02,137 --> 00:03:03,397
SELF TO LEFT.

26
00:03:08,227 --> 00:03:09,687
DON’T DIE.

27
00:03:09,687 --> 00:03:11,107
- ( hand slaps )
- ( gasps )

28
00:03:11,107 --> 00:03:13,197
Kirito: THAT’S ENOUGH, EUGEO.

29
00:03:13,197 --> 00:03:15,407
I THINK I’LL BE OKAY NOW.

30
00:03:15,407 --> 00:03:17,277
Eugeo: WHOA, TAKE IT EASY!

31
00:03:17,277 --> 00:03:18,947
YOU WERE HURT PRETTY BAD.

32
00:03:18,947 --> 00:03:22,577
YOU MIGHT HAVE INTERNAL WOUNDS
MY HEALING DIDN’T CATCH.

33
00:03:22,577 --> 00:03:25,497
IT’S NOT AS BAD AS WHEN
THOSE GOBLINS BEAT ME DOWN.

34
00:03:25,497 --> 00:03:28,497
ANYWAY, I’M WORRIED ABOUT HER.

35
00:03:28,497 --> 00:03:29,377
Eugeo: WHAT?

36
00:03:29,377 --> 00:03:31,337
WHO CARES?

37
00:03:31,337 --> 00:03:33,297
SHE TRIED TO KILL YOU,
REMEMBER?!

38
00:03:34,637 --> 00:03:36,597
I KNOW WHAT YOU SAID BEFORE,

39
00:03:36,597 --> 00:03:38,847
ABOUT LETTING HATE
GET THE BETTER OF ME.

40
00:03:38,847 --> 00:03:41,597
SHE WAS JUST DOING HER DUTY.

41
00:03:41,597 --> 00:03:44,517
SHE WASN’T FIGHTING FOR REVENGE
OR BECAUSE SHE HATED US.

42
00:03:44,517 --> 00:03:46,397
I GET THAT.

43
00:03:46,397 --> 00:03:47,817
STILL...

44
00:03:47,817 --> 00:03:49,647
THAT’S NO EXCUSE.

45
00:03:49,647 --> 00:03:52,607
I CAN’T FORGIVE THE CHURCH
OR THE INTEGRITY KNIGHTS.

46
00:03:52,607 --> 00:03:54,107
THEY HAVE ALL THIS POWER,

47
00:03:54,107 --> 00:03:56,527
BUT THEY’RE
JUST A BUNCH OF HYPOCRITES.

48
00:03:56,527 --> 00:04:00,117
IF THEY REALLY WANTED
TO PROTECT HUMANITY, THEY COULD.

49
00:04:00,117 --> 00:04:02,157
THEY’D RATHER
PROTECT A LIE INSTEAD.

50
00:04:03,997 --> 00:04:05,577
Kirito: I KNOW WHAT YOU MEAN,

51
00:04:05,577 --> 00:04:07,837
BUT YOU CAN’T FORGET
THESE KNIGHTS ARE HUMAN, TOO.

52
00:04:07,837 --> 00:04:09,997
THEY GOT THEIR OWN PROBLEMS,

53
00:04:09,997 --> 00:04:12,297
LIKE HOW THIS ONE FELT
FOR HER COMMANDER.

54
00:04:14,837 --> 00:04:18,387
I GOTTA SAY, YOUR PERFECT WEAPON
CONTROL ART’S AWESOME.

55
00:04:18,387 --> 00:04:21,927
THOSE KNIGHTS DIDN’T STAND
A CHANCE AGAINST IT.

56
00:04:21,927 --> 00:04:23,427
THIS FIGHT’S OVER.

57
00:04:23,427 --> 00:04:25,937
THERE’S NO REASON
TO HATE FANATIO

58
00:04:25,937 --> 00:04:29,357
AND THE FOUR WHIRLING BLADES
ANY MORE, SO LET IT GO.

59
00:04:30,897 --> 00:04:32,647
Eugeo: THEY’RE HUMAN.

60
00:04:32,647 --> 00:04:35,067
YEAH, YOU’RE RIGHT.

61
00:04:35,067 --> 00:04:38,067
I UNDERSTOOD THAT MUCH
ABOUT HER DURING THE FIGHT.

62
00:04:38,067 --> 00:04:40,157
SHE FOUGHT WITH HEART, LIKE US.

63
00:04:40,157 --> 00:04:42,077
I GUESS THAT’S WHY
SHE WAS SO POWERFUL.

64
00:04:42,077 --> 00:04:43,697
Kirito: YOU’RE RIGHT ABOUT THAT.

65
00:04:43,697 --> 00:04:45,327
IT’S ALL A MATTER
OF PERSPECTIVE,

66
00:04:45,327 --> 00:04:47,457
WHEN YOU THINK ABOUT IT.

67
00:04:47,457 --> 00:04:49,377
THE KNIGHTS
SEE THEMSELVES AS GOOD,

68
00:04:49,377 --> 00:04:51,377
WHILE YOU SEE THEM AS EVIL,

69
00:04:51,377 --> 00:04:54,087
BUT THE REALITY IS
YOU, ME, AND THESE KNIGHTS,

70
00:04:54,087 --> 00:04:57,177
WE’RE ALL HUMAN
AT THE END OF THE DAY,

71
00:04:57,177 --> 00:04:59,717
SO WHO’S TO SAY
WHO’S GOOD AND WHO’S BAD?

72
00:04:59,717 --> 00:05:00,847
( Eugeo sighs )

73
00:05:00,847 --> 00:05:01,887
Kirito: CRAP! ALMOST FORGOT.

74
00:05:01,887 --> 00:05:03,467
Eugeo: EH?

75
00:05:03,467 --> 00:05:05,307
Kirito: COULD YOU GIVE
THOSE TWO KNUCKLEHEADS

76
00:05:05,307 --> 00:05:07,347
SOME OF THAT ANTIDOTE FOR ME?

77
00:05:07,347 --> 00:05:10,017
DON’T FORGET TO SNAP
THEIR DAGGERS BEFORE YOU DO.

78
00:05:10,017 --> 00:05:13,147
OH, AND MAKE SURE THEY’RE
NOT PACKIN’ ANY OTHER TRICKS.

79
00:05:13,147 --> 00:05:16,737
Eugeo: WHAT ABOUT ADMINISTRATOR,
KIRITO?

80
00:05:16,737 --> 00:05:18,987
WILL YOU BE
AS UNDERSTANDING OF HER

81
00:05:18,987 --> 00:05:20,657
AS YOU ARE HER KNIGHTS?

82
00:05:26,657 --> 00:05:27,747
Kirito: HUH?

83
00:05:27,747 --> 00:05:29,077
( gasps )

84
00:05:34,297 --> 00:05:35,377
SYSTEM CALL.

85
00:05:35,377 --> 00:05:37,507
GENERATE LUMINOUS ELEMENT!

86
00:05:41,387 --> 00:05:43,307
- ( gasps )
- Eugeo: WHAT’S WRONG?!

87
00:05:43,307 --> 00:05:45,517
Kirito: I CAN’T STOP
THE BLEEDING!

88
00:05:45,517 --> 00:05:46,847
HELP ME!

89
00:05:46,847 --> 00:05:47,887
Eugeo: ALL RIGHT.

90
00:05:51,727 --> 00:05:53,477
THIS ISN’T WORKING.

91
00:05:53,477 --> 00:05:55,607
SHE’S LOST WAY TOO MUCH BLOOD.

92
00:05:55,607 --> 00:06:00,157
Kirito: BUT I CAN’T
JUST LET HER DIE LIKE THIS.

93
00:06:00,157 --> 00:06:04,737
SHE’S LIVED A HUNDRED YEARS,
WORRYING, LOVING, SUFFERING!

94
00:06:04,737 --> 00:06:05,987
SHE WAS ALIVE!

95
00:06:05,987 --> 00:06:07,907
I CAN’T LET HER SOUL GET ERASED!

96
00:06:07,907 --> 00:06:10,367
HELP US! THIS KNIGHT’S DYING!

97
00:06:10,367 --> 00:06:12,827
I KNOW THERE’S
MORE OF YOU OUT THERE!

98
00:06:12,827 --> 00:06:14,707
COME ON! ONE OF YOU NEEDS HELP!

99
00:06:15,837 --> 00:06:17,047
CAN ANYONE HEAR ME?!

100
00:06:17,047 --> 00:06:19,927
A PRIEST, A MONK! ANYONE!

101
00:06:21,047 --> 00:06:23,717
SHE’S DYING! HELP HER!

102
00:06:23,717 --> 00:06:25,387
PLEASE, YOU CAN’T LET HER DIE!

103
00:06:28,557 --> 00:06:29,427
THAT’S IT.

104
00:06:31,057 --> 00:06:32,597
Eugeo: WHAT DO YOU THINK
YOU’RE DOING?!

105
00:06:32,597 --> 00:06:34,687
YOU’RE SUPPOSED TO USE THAT
ON ADMINISTRATOR!

106
00:06:34,687 --> 00:06:36,107
Kirito: YEAH, I KNOW!

107
00:06:36,107 --> 00:06:39,357
BUT IF I USE IT ON HER,
I CAN SAVE HER.

108
00:06:39,357 --> 00:06:41,027
THIS DAGGER’S HER ONLY HOPE.

109
00:06:41,027 --> 00:06:42,487
I CAN SAVE HER WITH IT.

110
00:06:42,487 --> 00:06:44,447
I HAVE TO USE IT!

111
00:06:45,777 --> 00:06:47,697
♪

112
00:06:58,007 --> 00:06:58,917
Cardinal: GOODNESS GRACIOUS.

113
00:06:58,917 --> 00:07:00,627
YOU REALLY ARE SOMETHING.

114
00:07:00,627 --> 00:07:03,677
Kirito: C-CARDINAL!
SHE NEEDS HELP!

115
00:07:03,677 --> 00:07:05,717
I-I’M SORRY.
I KNOW I SHOULDN’T HAVE--

116
00:07:05,717 --> 00:07:06,887
Cardinal:
I KNOW WHAT’S HAPPENED,

117
00:07:06,887 --> 00:07:08,847
AND, PLEASE, DON’T APOLOGIZE.

118
00:07:08,847 --> 00:07:12,727
I WILL HEAL
FANATIO SYNTHESIS TWO.

119
00:07:12,727 --> 00:07:15,647
HOWEVER, I WILL
HAVE TO BRING HER TO ME,

120
00:07:15,647 --> 00:07:18,647
AS IT WILL TAKE SOME TIME
TO INITIATE A FULL RECOVERY.

121
00:07:22,817 --> 00:07:24,027
( both stammer )

122
00:07:24,027 --> 00:07:25,777
Cardinal: THESE POTIONS
WILL HEAL YOU.

123
00:07:25,777 --> 00:07:28,117
NOW, AS FAR AS I CAN TELL,

124
00:07:28,117 --> 00:07:30,827
ADMINISTRATOR IS NOT YET
IN HER WAKING STATE.

125
00:07:30,827 --> 00:07:34,667
IF YOU CAN MAKE IT TO
THE TOP FLOOR BEFORE SHE WAKES,

126
00:07:34,667 --> 00:07:38,247
YOU CAN STILL ELIMINATE HER
WITHOUT THE USE OF THE DAGGER.

127
00:07:38,247 --> 00:07:41,337
HURRY. ONLY A FEW
INTEGRITY KNIGHTS REMAIN.

128
00:07:42,627 --> 00:07:44,837
Kirito: I KINDA LOST IT THERE.
SORRY.

129
00:07:44,837 --> 00:07:48,387
Eugeo: NO. YOU DON’T
EVER HAVE TO APOLOGIZE.

130
00:07:56,977 --> 00:07:58,647
Kirito: HEY, DID YOU GET THAT?

131
00:07:58,647 --> 00:08:00,687
CARDINAL SAID
SOMETHING WEIRD JUST NOW,

132
00:08:00,687 --> 00:08:04,397
SOMETHING ABOUT
ADMINISTRATOR’S "WAKING STATE."

133
00:08:04,397 --> 00:08:07,027
Eugeo: PERHAPS SHE SPENDS
MOST OF HER TIME SLEEPING.

134
00:08:08,657 --> 00:08:10,077
Kirito: CARDINAL
SAID ADMINISTRATOR

135
00:08:10,077 --> 00:08:11,617
AND SOME OF HER KNIGHTS

136
00:08:11,617 --> 00:08:13,617
HAVE BEEN AROUND
FOR A COUPLE OF CENTURIES,

137
00:08:13,617 --> 00:08:16,667
SO WHO KNOWS WHAT KINDA STRAIN
THAT PUTS ON ’EM?

138
00:08:16,667 --> 00:08:18,747
MAYBE IT’S PART OF THE DEAL,

139
00:08:18,747 --> 00:08:22,087
ADMINISTRATOR HAS TO SLEEP
ALL DAY TO STAY ALIVE.

140
00:08:22,087 --> 00:08:25,587
OH, WELL. I GUESS WE’LL
FIND OUT ONCE WE GET UP THERE.

141
00:08:25,587 --> 00:08:27,507
♪

142
00:08:38,727 --> 00:08:41,687
( both gasp )

143
00:08:41,687 --> 00:08:43,437
Kirito: THE HECK IS THIS?

144
00:08:52,077 --> 00:08:53,697
WATCH OUT! SOMETHING’S COMIN’!

145
00:08:53,697 --> 00:08:54,407
( Eugeo gasps )

146
00:09:17,847 --> 00:09:19,437
Woman: THANK YOU FOR WAITING.

147
00:09:19,437 --> 00:09:21,147
WHICH FLOOR
WOULD YOU LIKE TO VISIT?

148
00:09:21,147 --> 00:09:23,857
Eugeo: "WHICH FLOOR"?

149
00:09:23,857 --> 00:09:26,777
DO YOU MEAN YOU CAN TAKE US
TO ANY OF THE FLOORS ABOVE?

150
00:09:28,237 --> 00:09:30,157
( Kirito sighs )

151
00:09:30,157 --> 00:09:33,237
UM, WE’RE FUGITIVES,

152
00:09:33,237 --> 00:09:36,247
AND WE SORTA, LIKE,
BROKE IN TO THE CATHEDRAL.

153
00:09:36,247 --> 00:09:39,037
ISN’T YOUR ELEVA--
I MEAN, FLOATING THING

154
00:09:39,037 --> 00:09:40,827
OFF LIMITS TO FOLKS LIKE US?

155
00:09:40,827 --> 00:09:42,627
Woman: I’M NOT SURE
WHAT YOU MEAN.

156
00:09:42,627 --> 00:09:45,917
ANYONE WHO WISHES TO USE
THIS PLATFORM MAY DO SO.

157
00:09:45,917 --> 00:09:49,297
MY JOB IS TO MERELY OPERATE IT,
NOTHING MORE.

158
00:09:49,297 --> 00:09:53,637
Kirito: OKAY. WE’LL TAKE YOU UP
ON YOUR OFFER, THEN.

159
00:09:53,637 --> 00:09:54,967
Eugeo: HEY, WAIT!

160
00:09:54,967 --> 00:09:57,057
ARE YOU SURE IT’S SAFE?!

161
00:09:57,057 --> 00:09:58,687
Kirito: OF COURSE!

162
00:09:58,687 --> 00:10:00,727
BESIDES, THERE’S
NO MORE STAIRS TO CLIMB.

163
00:10:00,727 --> 00:10:01,897
Eugeo: YEAH, BUT--

164
00:10:01,897 --> 00:10:03,937
OH, NEVER MIND.

165
00:10:03,937 --> 00:10:05,147
Kirito: ALL RIGHT.

166
00:10:05,147 --> 00:10:07,777
PLEASE TAKE US UP
AS HIGH AS YOU CAN.

167
00:10:07,777 --> 00:10:09,027
Woman: RIGHT AWAY, SIR.

168
00:10:11,697 --> 00:10:13,617
SYSTEM CALL.

169
00:10:13,617 --> 00:10:15,657
GENERATE AERIAL ELEMENT.

170
00:10:15,657 --> 00:10:17,497
( Eugeo gasps )

171
00:10:20,077 --> 00:10:21,667
Woman: BURST ELEMENT.

172
00:10:23,997 --> 00:10:25,667
( platform humming )

173
00:10:30,127 --> 00:10:32,427
( Kirito sighs )

174
00:10:32,427 --> 00:10:35,097
SO HAVE YOU BEEN DOING THIS
FOR A WHILE NOW?

175
00:10:37,177 --> 00:10:39,637
Woman:
AS A MATTER OF FACT, I HAVE.

176
00:10:39,637 --> 00:10:41,727
FOR 107 YEARS, ACTUALLY.

177
00:10:41,727 --> 00:10:44,187
Eugeo: 107 YEARS!

178
00:10:44,187 --> 00:10:46,897
AND THIS IS ALL YOU DO,
DAY IN AND DAY OUT?

179
00:10:46,897 --> 00:10:49,277
Woman: NOT QUITE. I GET BREAKS.

180
00:10:49,277 --> 00:10:52,567
I’M ALLOWED TO TAKE ONE AT NOON
TO HAVE MY LUNCH,

181
00:10:52,567 --> 00:10:55,827
AND THEN AT NIGHT
I GET TO SLEEP, SO THERE’S THAT.

182
00:10:55,827 --> 00:10:57,867
Eugeo: THAT’S NOT QUITE
WHAT I MEAN.

183
00:10:57,867 --> 00:11:00,707
Kirito: UM, WHAT’S YOUR NAME?

184
00:11:00,707 --> 00:11:02,827
Woman: MY NAME...

185
00:11:02,827 --> 00:11:05,167
I SEEM TO HAVE FORGOTTEN IT.

186
00:11:05,167 --> 00:11:07,167
HUH. THAT MAKES SENSE.

187
00:11:07,167 --> 00:11:09,797
"OPERATOR" IS ALL
ANYONE CALLS ME ANYMORE.

188
00:11:12,757 --> 00:11:14,757
Eugeo: I THINK WE CAN HELP.

189
00:11:14,757 --> 00:11:16,217
WE, UM...

190
00:11:16,217 --> 00:11:19,097
WE CAME HERE TO BRING DOWN
THE HEAD OF THE CHURCH,

191
00:11:19,097 --> 00:11:22,227
THE ONE WHO FORCED
THIS CALLING ONTO YOU.

192
00:11:22,227 --> 00:11:24,147
Operator: YOU DON’T SAY?

193
00:11:24,147 --> 00:11:25,767
Eugeo: IF THE CHURCH IS GONE,

194
00:11:25,767 --> 00:11:27,727
YOU’LL BE RELEASED
FROM YOUR CALLING.

195
00:11:27,727 --> 00:11:31,237
YOU’LL BE FREE
TO DO WHATEVER YOU WANT.

196
00:11:31,237 --> 00:11:33,067
Operator: IS THAT SO?

197
00:11:33,067 --> 00:11:35,317
I’M AT A LOSS.

198
00:11:35,317 --> 00:11:38,617
I DON’T KNOW ANYTHING
OF THE WORLD OUTSIDE THIS SHAFT.

199
00:11:38,617 --> 00:11:42,747
THEREFORE, I HAVE NO IDEA
WHAT NEW CALLING I WOULD CHOOSE.

200
00:11:45,207 --> 00:11:49,127
ALTHOUGH, IF I COULD WISH
FOR ANYTHING ELSE TO DO...

201
00:11:53,297 --> 00:11:56,387
I WISH I COULD FLY
THIS PLATFORM OUTSIDE

202
00:11:56,387 --> 00:11:59,137
AND GO WHEREVER I WANTED.

203
00:12:08,687 --> 00:12:10,777
THANK YOU FOR YOUR PATIENCE.

204
00:12:10,777 --> 00:12:13,897
THIS IS THE 80th FLOOR,
THE CLOUDTOP GARDEN.

205
00:12:15,657 --> 00:12:17,567
Eugeo: I DIDN’T THINK
ANYTHING IN THIS WORLD

206
00:12:17,567 --> 00:12:19,487
COULD BE MORE BORING
THAN MY CALLING,

207
00:12:19,487 --> 00:12:22,997
BUT IT’S NOTHING
COMPARED TO HERS.

208
00:12:22,997 --> 00:12:26,117
I COULD LOOK FORWARD
TO GROWING OLD AND RETIRING.

209
00:12:26,117 --> 00:12:28,287
SHE’S STUCK WITH HERS FOREVER.

210
00:12:28,287 --> 00:12:31,377
Kirito: CARDINAL SAID THAT
EVEN IF YOU STOPPED A PERSON

211
00:12:31,377 --> 00:12:33,337
FROM AGING WITH A SACRED ART,

212
00:12:33,337 --> 00:12:36,297
THERE’S NO WAY
TO STOP THEIR SOUL FROM AGING.

213
00:12:36,297 --> 00:12:38,467
LITTLE BY LITTLE,
THEIR MEMORY CRUMBLES,

214
00:12:38,467 --> 00:12:40,677
AND IN THE END
IT FALLS APART.

215
00:12:42,057 --> 00:12:44,637
THE AXIOM CHURCH
IS STRAIGHT-UP EVIL.

216
00:12:46,977 --> 00:12:49,187
WE’RE THE ONLY ONES
WHO CAN STOP ADMINISTRATOR

217
00:12:49,187 --> 00:12:50,147
AND FREE EVERYONE.

218
00:12:50,147 --> 00:12:52,027
IT’S A START,

219
00:12:52,027 --> 00:12:55,897
BUT THAT’S NOT THE END
OF THIS WORLD’S PROBLEMS.

220
00:12:55,897 --> 00:12:59,067
THE REAL CHALLENGE
IS WHAT COMES AFTER.

221
00:12:59,067 --> 00:13:02,117
Eugeo: I THOUGHT,
AFTER WE DEFEATED ADMINISTRATOR,

222
00:13:02,117 --> 00:13:05,287
CARDINAL WOULD MAKE THINGS
RIGHT AGAIN. WON’T SHE?

223
00:13:05,287 --> 00:13:06,917
Kirito: UH...

224
00:13:06,917 --> 00:13:08,497
SORT OF.

225
00:13:08,497 --> 00:13:11,037
WE CAN TALK ABOUT IT
AFTER WE GET ALICE BACK.

226
00:13:11,037 --> 00:13:12,497
Eugeo: OKAY.

227
00:13:20,007 --> 00:13:21,677
( both grunting )

228
00:13:27,017 --> 00:13:28,687
( stream flowing )

229
00:13:32,227 --> 00:13:33,977
( Kirito gasps )

230
00:13:33,977 --> 00:13:35,067
Eugeo: AMAZING.

231
00:13:50,077 --> 00:13:51,287
( gasps )

232
00:13:52,417 --> 00:13:54,377
♪

233
00:13:54,377 --> 00:13:55,707
( gasps )

234
00:14:03,257 --> 00:14:06,597
( gasps ) A-ALICE.

235
00:14:10,187 --> 00:14:11,517
Alice: PLEASE WAIT.

236
00:14:11,517 --> 00:14:14,397
I WANT TO LET HER
SOAK IN THE SUN.

237
00:14:14,397 --> 00:14:17,397
NOT FOR LONG.
A FEW MORE MOMENTS WILL DO.

238
00:14:20,277 --> 00:14:22,407
( Eugeo sighs )

239
00:14:22,407 --> 00:14:24,487
Kirito: LET ME
DO THE FIGHTING, OKAY?

240
00:14:24,487 --> 00:14:27,157
BE READY WITH THE DAGGER.

241
00:14:27,157 --> 00:14:29,407
THAT’S THE ONLY WAY
YOU’RE GONNA GET HER BACK.

242
00:14:29,407 --> 00:14:31,247
I’LL BLOCK HER STRIKES,

243
00:14:31,247 --> 00:14:33,377
WITH MY BODY
IF IT COMES DOWN TO IT.

244
00:14:33,377 --> 00:14:35,457
Eugeo: BUT CAN’T WE--

245
00:14:35,457 --> 00:14:37,337
Kirito: LOOK,
THERE’S NO OTHER WAY.

246
00:14:37,337 --> 00:14:40,217
I’LL CHARGE ALICE,
TAKE THE HIT, AND PIN HER DOWN.

247
00:14:40,217 --> 00:14:43,297
THEN YOU STICK HER
WITH THE DAGGER! GOT IT?

248
00:14:43,297 --> 00:14:44,757
Eugeo: SORRY.

249
00:14:44,757 --> 00:14:46,427
Kirito: NAH,
DON’T WORRY ABOUT IT.

250
00:14:46,427 --> 00:14:49,057
IF THIS WORKS,
YOU CAN PAY ME BACK LATER.

251
00:14:49,057 --> 00:14:52,017
I CAN’T TELL IF SHE’S
GOT HER SWORD OR NOT.

252
00:14:52,017 --> 00:14:54,437
EH, IT DOESN’T MATTER.
WE’LL GET TO HER

253
00:14:54,437 --> 00:14:57,107
BEFORE SHE CAN FINISH CASTING
HER PERFECT WEAPON CONTROL.

254
00:14:57,107 --> 00:14:59,857
BUT WE GOTTA ATTACK NOW,
’CAUSE THE MORE WE WAIT,

255
00:14:59,857 --> 00:15:01,527
THE MORE TIME
SHE HAS TO CAST IT.

256
00:15:01,527 --> 00:15:03,067
Eugeo: YOU’RE RIGHT.

257
00:15:03,067 --> 00:15:05,447
AND IF SHE DOES
FINISH CASTING IT,

258
00:15:05,447 --> 00:15:07,537
I THINK I CAN USE MINE
TWO MORE TIMES

259
00:15:07,537 --> 00:15:09,657
BEFORE I HAVE TO RESTORE IT.

260
00:15:09,657 --> 00:15:11,117
Kirito: THAT’S OUR BACKUP PLAN.

261
00:15:11,117 --> 00:15:13,327
I CAN ONLY USE MINE
ONE MORE TIME,

262
00:15:13,327 --> 00:15:15,087
AND WE STILL GOTTA DEAL

263
00:15:15,087 --> 00:15:17,297
WITH THE COMMANDER
OF THE KNIGHTS AFTER ALICE.

264
00:15:17,297 --> 00:15:19,757
COME ON. LET’S DO THIS.

265
00:15:22,007 --> 00:15:23,547
Alice: AGAINST ALL ODDS,

266
00:15:23,547 --> 00:15:26,257
YOU TWO HAVE MADE IT
ALL THE WAY UP HERE.

267
00:15:26,257 --> 00:15:29,807
I ANTICIPATED YOUR ESCAPE
FROM THE PRISON,

268
00:15:29,807 --> 00:15:32,597
BUT I DID NOT ANTICIPATE
WHAT HAPPENED NEXT.

269
00:15:32,597 --> 00:15:34,187
ELDRIE SHOULD HAVE CAUGHT YOU,

270
00:15:34,187 --> 00:15:37,067
YET YOU DEFEATED HIM,
THEN DEUSOLBERT.

271
00:15:37,067 --> 00:15:38,687
I HAVE NO IDEA HOW.

272
00:15:38,687 --> 00:15:41,527
AND THEN
YOU DEFEATED FANATIO AS WELL,

273
00:15:41,527 --> 00:15:43,527
AND NOW YOU HAVE SET FOOT HERE.

274
00:15:43,527 --> 00:15:46,197
IT IS SHOCKING.

275
00:15:46,197 --> 00:15:48,737
WHERE DO YOU GET THE POWER
TO OVERCOME SUCH KNIGHTS?

276
00:15:48,737 --> 00:15:51,497
WHY DO YOU WISH
TO DISRUPT THE ORDER HERE?

277
00:15:51,497 --> 00:15:53,327
EXPLAIN YOURSELVES.

278
00:15:54,997 --> 00:15:56,127
VERY WELL.

279
00:15:56,127 --> 00:15:58,037
I WILL GET ANSWERS
WITH MY BLADE.

280
00:16:01,297 --> 00:16:02,377
Kirito: NO WAY.

281
00:16:02,377 --> 00:16:04,297
♪

282
00:16:09,637 --> 00:16:11,557
DAMN IT, HER SWORD!

283
00:16:11,557 --> 00:16:14,347
IT’S ALREADY IN PERFECT CONTROL!

284
00:16:14,347 --> 00:16:15,557
( both grunt )

285
00:16:27,987 --> 00:16:29,487
( chorus vocalizing )

286
00:16:33,617 --> 00:16:35,327
- ( Kirito groans )
- ( Eugeo groans )

287
00:16:39,207 --> 00:16:41,127
♪

288
00:16:43,457 --> 00:16:45,677
( groaning )

289
00:16:45,677 --> 00:16:48,677
Alice: WHY DID YOU
NOT DRAW YOUR SWORDS?

290
00:16:48,677 --> 00:16:51,177
IF YOU WERE MOCKING ME,
KNOW THIS.

291
00:16:51,177 --> 00:16:52,847
I INTENTIONALLY HELD BACK

292
00:16:52,847 --> 00:16:54,847
ON THAT STRIKE JUST NOW
AS A WARNING.

293
00:16:54,847 --> 00:16:59,307
THE NEXT ONE SHALL ELIMINATE
YOUR LIVES ENTIRELY.

294
00:16:59,307 --> 00:17:01,727
FOR THE HONOR OF THE KNIGHTS
YOU’VE DEFEATED,

295
00:17:01,727 --> 00:17:04,237
I INSIST YOU
ATTACK ME IN EARNEST.

296
00:17:04,237 --> 00:17:05,107
( Eugeo grunts )

297
00:17:07,607 --> 00:17:08,617
Eugeo: SYSTEM CALL.

298
00:17:10,277 --> 00:17:12,827
Kirito: PLEASE ACCEPT
OUR HUMBLE APOLOGIES.

299
00:17:12,827 --> 00:17:15,457
WE DIDN’T MEAN
TO DISRESPECT YOU JUST NOW.

300
00:17:16,537 --> 00:17:18,667
MY NAME IS KIRITO.

301
00:17:18,667 --> 00:17:20,837
I’M A SWORDSMAN-IN-TRAINING,

302
00:17:20,837 --> 00:17:23,377
AND I WISH TO DUEL WITH YOU,
LADY ALICE.

303
00:17:24,707 --> 00:17:26,297
Alice: VERY WELL.

304
00:17:26,297 --> 00:17:28,677
LET US SEE
JUST HOW WICKED YOU ARE

305
00:17:28,677 --> 00:17:31,257
BY THE QUALITY
OF YOUR SWORDSMANSHIP.

306
00:17:41,517 --> 00:17:43,727
Kirito: BEFORE WE START THIS UP,

307
00:17:43,727 --> 00:17:45,527
I GOT A QUESTION FOR YOU.

308
00:17:45,527 --> 00:17:47,737
IF THAT TREE WE SAW
JUST NOW’S YOUR SWORD,

309
00:17:47,737 --> 00:17:50,567
THAT MEANS IT’S ITS TRUE FORM.

310
00:17:50,567 --> 00:17:53,577
SO HOW CAN A TREE THAT SMALL
BE SO POWERFUL?

311
00:17:55,077 --> 00:17:56,367
Alice: LONG AGO,

312
00:17:56,367 --> 00:17:58,367
THE SPOT WHERE
THE CENTRAL CATHEDRAL STANDS

313
00:17:58,367 --> 00:18:00,327
WAS THE "PLACE OF BEGINNINGS,"

314
00:18:00,327 --> 00:18:03,667
A PLACE WHICH STACIA,
THE GODDESS OF CREATION,

315
00:18:03,667 --> 00:18:06,087
GIFTED TO HUMANITY.

316
00:18:06,087 --> 00:18:08,257
IN THE CENTER OF A TINY VILLAGE,

317
00:18:08,257 --> 00:18:10,007
THERE WAS A BEAUTIFUL SPRING.

318
00:18:10,007 --> 00:18:14,757
ON ITS BANKS, THERE GREW
A SINGLE OSMANTHUS TREE.

319
00:18:14,757 --> 00:18:17,227
THIS WEAPON,
THE OSMANTHUS BLADE,

320
00:18:17,227 --> 00:18:19,017
WAS FORGED FROM IT,

321
00:18:19,017 --> 00:18:23,357
A TREE CREATED
BY THE GODDESS REINCARNATED,

322
00:18:23,357 --> 00:18:25,647
THE OLDEST THING IN EXISTENCE,

323
00:18:25,647 --> 00:18:27,817
A DIVINE WEAPON, INDEED.

324
00:18:27,817 --> 00:18:31,527
EVERLASTING ETERNITY
IS ITS ATTRIBUTE.

325
00:18:31,527 --> 00:18:36,827
A SINGLE PETAL CAN SPLIT STONE
OR TEAR THE GROUND ASUNDER.

326
00:18:36,827 --> 00:18:38,367
Kirito: YOU DON’T SAY.

327
00:18:38,367 --> 00:18:39,957
THAT’S A GREAT SCORE.

328
00:18:39,957 --> 00:18:42,707
IT’S THIS WORLD’S
FIRST INDESTRUCTIBLE OBJECT.

329
00:18:42,707 --> 00:18:44,207
THANKS FOR SHARING!

330
00:18:44,207 --> 00:18:46,797
BUT WE SHOULD
GET BACK TO BUSINESS NOW.

331
00:18:46,797 --> 00:18:49,587
ALL RIGHT,
INTEGRITY KNIGHT ALICE.

332
00:18:49,587 --> 00:18:52,297
IF YOU’RE READY, EN GARDE!

333
00:18:52,297 --> 00:18:54,137
♪

334
00:18:54,137 --> 00:18:55,847
( chorus vocalizing )

335
00:19:02,557 --> 00:19:04,607
( Alice yells )

336
00:19:12,567 --> 00:19:13,737
( Kirito groans )

337
00:19:23,247 --> 00:19:25,127
Alice: YOU ARE THE SECOND PERSON

338
00:19:25,127 --> 00:19:27,707
TO WITHSTAND MY ATTACKS
FOR THIS LONG.

339
00:19:27,707 --> 00:19:30,627
YOUR WILL AND DEDICATION
ARE APPARENT.

340
00:19:30,627 --> 00:19:32,467
THEY BROUGHT YOU THIS FAR.

341
00:19:32,467 --> 00:19:35,677
HOWEVER, THE CHURCH
IS FAR GREATER THAN YOUR WILL,

342
00:19:35,677 --> 00:19:37,427
AND I WILL NOT ALLOW YOU

343
00:19:37,427 --> 00:19:40,057
TO DISTURB THE PEACE
OF THIS REALM ANY LONGER.

344
00:19:41,137 --> 00:19:43,807
FAREWELL, HUMAN.

345
00:19:43,807 --> 00:19:46,147
( chorus vocalizing )

346
00:19:53,197 --> 00:19:54,487
( Alice gasps )

347
00:19:57,407 --> 00:19:59,827
Eugeo: ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

348
00:19:59,827 --> 00:20:02,407
♪

349
00:20:29,397 --> 00:20:30,067
( gasps )

350
00:20:42,447 --> 00:20:44,367
Alice: WELL, NOW,
THAT WAS AMUSING

351
00:20:44,367 --> 00:20:46,247
AND QUITE FUTILE.

352
00:20:46,247 --> 00:20:48,837
MERE ICE
CANNOT WITHSTAND MY FLOWERS.

353
00:20:48,837 --> 00:20:51,127
I SHALL FIGHT YOU NEXT,

354
00:20:51,127 --> 00:20:53,167
SO BE PATIENT,
AND WAIT YOUR TURN.

355
00:20:54,757 --> 00:20:57,837
Kirito: ENHANCE ARMAMENT!

356
00:21:03,717 --> 00:21:04,887
( Alice gasps )

357
00:21:04,887 --> 00:21:06,347
HE WENT FOR MY SWORD.

358
00:21:06,347 --> 00:21:07,557
Kirito: NOW, EUGEO!

359
00:21:12,897 --> 00:21:15,447
( breeze blowing )

360
00:21:20,697 --> 00:21:21,527
( Eugeo gasps )

361
00:21:32,377 --> 00:21:35,297
( wind blowing )

362
00:21:35,297 --> 00:21:37,177
KIRITO?

363
00:21:38,717 --> 00:21:40,257
ALICE?

364
00:21:43,557 --> 00:21:44,217
( gasps )

365
00:21:46,517 --> 00:21:48,637
( yells )

366
00:21:52,607 --> 00:21:55,817
( yells ) NO!

367
00:21:59,737 --> 00:22:00,867
KIRITO!

368
00:22:02,487 --> 00:22:05,447
ALICE!

369
00:22:05,447 --> 00:22:09,537
♪ OH, EVERYTHING
TURNS TO ASH, TO ASH ♪

370
00:22:09,537 --> 00:22:11,207
( singing in Japanese )

371
00:22:19,087 --> 00:22:22,547
♪ AND EVERYTHING
TURNS TO DUST, TO DUST ♪

372
00:22:22,547 --> 00:22:24,217
( singing in Japanese )

373
00:22:31,977 --> 00:22:33,937
♪ FORGET-ME-NOT ♪

